            <div class="px-6 pb-6 text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">ACoS only measures your ad spend against ad-attributed revenue. TACoS measures it against total Amazon revenue, organic and paid combined. As advertising improves your organic rank and organic sales grow, your TACoS falls even if ACoS stays flat. TACoS is the true measure of whether your advertising investment is building a scalable, profitable business.</div>
